# The governance boundary. This repo is the traffic lane partners submit into,
# so ownership is split by blast radius.
#
# Replace @owner / @reviewers with real handles or teams before enabling branch
# protection -- CODEOWNERS silently matches nothing if the handle is not a
# repository collaborator.

# Constitution: rare, high-impact, owner only. A schema change re-validates
# every existing contract, so it is never a routine review.
/schema/**      @owner
/templates/**   @owner

# The gate itself. Weakening a check is as consequential as changing the rules.
/scripts/**     @owner
/.github/**     @owner

# Case law: frequent, normal review. This is where submissions land.
/contracts/**   @owner @reviewers
